The `aspirate.json` it self, containe the following configuration:

```json
{
  "TemplatePath": null,
  "ContainerSettings": {
    "Registry": null,
    "RepositoryPrefix": null,
    "Tags": [
      "latest"
    ],
    "Builder": "docker",
    "BuildArgs": null,
    "Context": null
  }
}
```

Then we can generate k8s manifests by executing the following command:

```bash
$ aspirate generate

